(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Deborah did a lot of push-ups yesterday.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:06,980
She usually never did any at all.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,480
When she woke up the next day, her

4
