14
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,900
She told him about the push-ups.

15
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,880
Now I see.

16
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:47,980
After you exercise a lot, you get sore

17
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,300
the next day, her dad said.

18
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:53,320
What can I do in order to not

19
00:00:53,320 --> 00:00:54,220
get sore?

20
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:58,040
What can I do in order not to

21
00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:58,880
get sore?

22
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:00,060
Deborah asked.

23
00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:02,760
Stretch, her dad said.
